{"id":"CH-Distribution","title":"14. 分布式","html":"<div class=\"sect1\"> <h2 id=\"CH-Distribution\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"CH-Distribution\" href=\"#CH-Distribution\">14. 分布式</a></h2> <div class=\"sectionbody\"> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 的设计目标之一就是支持分布式计算。本章将探讨 Erlang 中分布式的关键方面，包括节点、连接和消息传递。</p> </div> <div class=\"sect2\"> <h3 id=\"_nodes_and_connections\"><a class=\"link\" data-ref=\"_nodes_and_connections\" href=\"#_nodes_and_connections\">14.1. 节点与连接</a></h3> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 Erlang 中，节点（node）是 Erlang 运行时系统的一个实例。按照规范的说法，它实际上是一个具名的、正在运行的 ERTS 实例，因为只有具名实例才能通过 Erlang 分布式机制相互通信。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在本书中，我们常常也会（多少有些不严谨地）把未启用分布式、没有名字的实例称作节点。它们仍然可以与其他子系统通信，例如通过 http，或者直接通过 TCP。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>每个真正的节点都有一个唯一的名字，通常由一个原子、一个 '@' 符号和主机名组成。例如 node1@localhost。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>节点的名字既可以是短名，也可以是长名。短名由原子构成，不包含主机名，如 <code>node1</code>。当所有节点都运行在同一台主机上时使用短名。长名则同时包含原子和主机名，如 <code>node1@localhost</code>。当节点分布在不同主机上时使用长名。需要注意的是，使用短名的节点只能与同样使用短名的节点通信，使用长名的节点也只能与使用长名的节点通信。因此，在分布式系统中，让所有节点采用一致的命名方式至关重要。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>节点之间可以使用 <code>net_kernel:connect_node/1</code> 函数建立连接。节点的名字由两部分组成：一个名字（原子）和一个主机名。格式为 <code>name@hostname</code>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果在启动节点时不指定名字，就无法连接到另一个节点：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"elixir\"><span class=\"n\">happi</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"ss\">:~</span><span class=\"err\">$</span> <span class=\"n\">iex</span>\n<span class=\"no\">Erlang</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"no\">OTP</span> <span class=\"mi\">24</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">erts</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">12.0</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">bit</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"ss\">smp:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"ss\">ds:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"ss\">threads:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">jit</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"no\">Interactive</span> <span class=\"no\">Elixir</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.12</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">press</span> <span class=\"no\">Ctrl</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"no\">C</span> <span class=\"n\">to</span> <span class=\"k\">exit</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">type</span> <span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"no\">ENTER</span> <span class=\"n\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">help</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"no\">Node</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">alive?</span>\n<span class=\"no\">false</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"ss\">:net_kernel</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">connect_node</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"ss\">:foo</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"ss\">:ignored</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"no\">Node</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">alive?</span>\n<span class=\"no\">false</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果在启动节点时指定了名字，就可以连接到另一个节点：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"elixir\"><span class=\"n\">happi</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"ss\">:~</span><span class=\"err\">$</span> <span class=\"n\">iex</span> <span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">sname</span> <span class=\"n\">bar</span>\n<span class=\"no\">Erlang</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"no\">OTP</span> <span class=\"mi\">24</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">erts</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">12.0</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">bit</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"ss\">smp:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"ss\">ds:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"ss\">threads:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">jit</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"no\">Interactive</span> <span class=\"no\">Elixir</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.12</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">press</span> <span class=\"no\">Ctrl</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"no\">C</span> <span class=\"n\">to</span> <span class=\"k\">exit</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">type</span> <span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"no\">ENTER</span> <span class=\"n\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">help</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"no\">Node</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">alive?</span>\n<span class=\"no\">true</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"ss\">:net_kernel</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">connect_node</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"ss\">:foo</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"no\">true</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"no\">Node</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">alive?</span>\n<span class=\"no\">true</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">bar</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果你不想费心为节点取名，可以用特殊名字 <code>undefined</code> 来启动它，之后当你连接到另一个节点时，系统会为你的节点取一个名字：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre class=\"rouge highlight\"><code data-lang=\"elixir\"><span class=\"n\">happi</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"ss\">:~</span><span class=\"err\">$</span> <span class=\"n\">iex</span> <span class=\"o\">--</span><span class=\"n\">sname</span> <span class=\"n\">undefined</span>\n<span class=\"no\">Erlang</span><span class=\"o\">/</span><span class=\"no\">OTP</span> <span class=\"mi\">24</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">erts</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"mf\">12.0</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">source</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"mi\">64</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"n\">bit</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"ss\">smp:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"ss\">ds:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">12</span><span class=\"p\">:</span><span class=\"mi\">10</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">async</span><span class=\"o\">-</span><span class=\"ss\">threads:</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">]</span> <span class=\"p\">[</span><span class=\"n\">jit</span><span class=\"p\">]</span>\n\n<span class=\"no\">Interactive</span> <span class=\"no\">Elixir</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mf\">1.12</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span> <span class=\"o\">-</span> <span class=\"n\">press</span> <span class=\"no\">Ctrl</span><span class=\"o\">+</span><span class=\"no\">C</span> <span class=\"n\">to</span> <span class=\"k\">exit</span> <span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"n\">type</span> <span class=\"n\">h</span><span class=\"p\">()</span> <span class=\"no\">ENTER</span> <span class=\"n\">for</span> <span class=\"n\">help</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">1</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"no\">Node</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">alive?</span>\n<span class=\"no\">false</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"mi\">2</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"ss\">:net_kernel</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">connect_node</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"ss\">:foo</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span>\n<span class=\"no\">true</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">2</span><span class=\"no\">YOVGWCSCSR8R</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"mi\">3</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span> <span class=\"no\">Node</span><span class=\"o\">.</span><span class=\"n\">alive?</span>\n<span class=\"no\">true</span>\n<span class=\"n\">iex</span><span class=\"p\">(</span><span class=\"err\">2</span><span class=\"no\">YOVGWCSCSR8R</span><span class=\"nv\">@gdc12</span><span class=\"p\">)</span><span class=\"mi\">4</span><span class=\"o\">&gt;</span></code></pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>即使启动系统时没有加 <code>name</code> 或 <code>sname</code> 标志，也可以手动启动分布式功能：</p> </div> <div class=\"listingblock\"> <div class=\"content\"> <pre>Eshell V15.2.2 (press Ctrl+G to abort, type help(). for help)\n1&gt; node().\nnonode@nohost\n2&gt; net_kernel:start([baz, shortnames]).\n{ok,&lt;0.92.0&gt;}\n(baz@gdc12)3&gt; node().\nbaz@gdc12</pre> </div> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>只要节点使用相同的「cookie」，它们就可以相互连接。cookie 是一种安全措施，用于确保只有经过授权的节点才能建立连接。cookie 就是一个简单的原子，所有需要互相连接的节点上它都必须相同。如果 cookie 不匹配，连接就不会建立。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>你可以在启动 Erlang 节点时用 <code>-setcookie</code> 选项设置 cookie，也可以在运行时用 <code>erlang:set_cookie/2</code> 函数动态设置。如果没有设置 cookie，那么 Erlang 节点启动时会被赋予一个随机原子作为默认的魔法 cookie（magic cookie），而其他节点的 cookie 则被假定为 <code>nocookie</code>。这个魔法 cookie 充当节点之间的基本认证机制。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 网络认证服务器也称为 <code>auth</code>，它执行的第一个操作是在用户主目录中查找名为 <code>.erlang.cookie</code> 的文件，然后再查找由 <code>filename:basedir(user_config, \"erlang\")</code> 指定的目录。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>如果这两个文件都不存在，<code>auth</code> 会主动在用户主目录中创建一个 <code>.erlang.cookie</code> 文件。该文件被赋予 UNIX 权限，对用户而言是只读的。文件内容是一个随机生成的字符串。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>随后，会得到一个名为 <code>Cookie</code> 的原子，它由 <code>.erlang.cookie</code> 文件的内容生成。接着用 <code>erlang:set_cookie(Cookie)</code> 函数把这个原子设为本地节点的 cookie。这一操作确立了本地节点在与所有其他节点交互时所用的默认 cookie。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>这一过程为分布式 Erlang 系统中的节点相互通信提供了基本的安全性和认证保障。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>连接一旦建立，节点之间就可以自由通信。节点之间的连接是透明的。这意味着，只要彼此相连，你向另一个节点上的进程发送消息，就和向同一节点上的进程发送消息完全一样。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在 Erlang 分布式系统中，节点默认是全连接的。当节点 N1 连接到另一个节点 N2 时，它会获得一份 N2 已连接的所有节点的列表，并连接到其中每一个。由于连接是双向的，N2 也会连接到 N1 所连接的所有节点。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>在启动系统时使用命令行标志 <code>-connect_all false</code> 可以关闭这一行为。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 也支持节点之间的 SSL 连接。当你需要保护节点之间的通信时（例如节点通过不可信网络通信），这种连接非常有用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>要让节点连接使用 SSL，你需要配置 ssl 应用以及 inet_dist 的 listen 和 connect 选项。这涉及设置 SSL 证书和密钥，并把 Erlang 运行时系统配置为在节点间通信时使用 SSL。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>请记住，由于加解密带来的开销，使用 SSL 会影响性能。因此应当审慎使用，只有在安全通信带来的收益超过性能代价时才启用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>Erlang 中的隐藏节点（hidden node）是一种特殊的节点，可以在分布式 Erlang 系统中建立连接，而不必完全加入节点网络。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>当使用 <code>-hidden</code> 选项把节点启动为隐藏节点时，在其他节点上由 <code>nodes()</code> 函数返回的节点列表中不会出现它，它也不会自动与系统中的其他节点建立连接。不过，它可以用 <code>net_kernel:connect_node/1</code> 与单个节点建立连接，而且这些连接功能完整：可用于消息传递、创建进程以及其他分布式操作。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>隐藏节点的主要用途之一是建立与网络其余部分相隔离的连接。例如，你可能想把某个节点连接到一组特定的节点，而不与系统中的所有节点相连。这对于管理网络流量、隔离某些操作，或是在更大的分布式系统中构建子网都很有用。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>隐藏节点的另一个用途，是应对节点网络规模庞大且动态变化的系统：此时让每个节点都与所有其他节点保持连接既不现实也不可取。借助隐藏节点，可以构建更灵活、更具可扩展性的网络拓扑。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>需要注意的是，隐藏节点并不是一项安全特性。虽然它们不会出现在 <code>nodes()</code> 列表中，也不会自动连接到其他节点，但它们并不能提供任何额外的保护来防止未授权访问或窃听。如果需要保障分布式 Erlang 系统的安全，应当使用基于 cookie 的认证以及 SSL/TLS 加密等机制。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>关于 Erlang 层面分布式的完整说明，包括命令行标志以及有用的模块和函数，请阅读 Distributed Erlang 参考手册 <sup class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnote_source-distribution-distributed-html\">[<a class=\"footnote\" data-ref=\"_footnotedef_53\" href=\"#_footnotedef_53\" id=\"_footnoteref_53\">53</a>]</sup>。</p> </div> <div class=\"paragraph\"> <p>现在我们来看看更有意思的内容：这一切在 BEAM 中是如何实现的。</p> </div> </div> </div> </div><div class=\"footnotes\"><hr><div class=\"footnote\" id=\"_footnotedef_53\"> <a data-ref=\"_footnoteref_53\" href=\"#_footnoteref_53\">53</a>. <a class=\"bare\" href=\"https://www.erlang.org/doc/reference_manual/distributed.html\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.erlang.org/doc/reference_manual/distributed.html</a> </div></div>"}